X:1
T:Walking on the Moon
C:Sting (The Police)
M:4/4
O:England, 1979
N:Verse and bridge. Melody from the vocal-line channel (channel 3) of a hamienet.com MIDI arrangement (track 352643350418132), cross-checked against a second arrangement (track 5134). Chords from its guitar and bass channels (Fsus4 Fsus4 Eb F in the verse, Eb Bb F Cm in the bridge). Transposed down a fifth from C to F mixolydian so the range is C4 to F5. The final verse note is held four beats instead of the original six to make the loop a whole number of bars. Humanized onsets snapped to the sixteenth grid.
